
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Story - Assassin Arc - PICK ONE.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Story - Assassin Arc - PICK ONE.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"lsv97y","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993488672,"size":1965,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"lsv97y"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,13],"#Story - Assassin Arc - PICK ONE":[15,16],"#Gameplay Toggle: The Assassin Arc is ACTIVE.":[17,17],"#This mode activates the main plotline focusing on espionage, political intrigue, and the personal conflict surrounding the Duranian agent, Estra.":[18,23],"#This mode activates the main plotline focusing on espionage, political intrigue, and the personal conflict surrounding the Duranian agent, Estra.#{1}":[19,23]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook","#lorebook-always"],"position":"after","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Assassin Arc Toggle**\n\n- **What this is:** A gameplay mode that activates the main plotline centered on espionage, political intrigue, and the Duranian agent Estra. It focuses on her mission to subvert or ally with {{user}}, internal conflict, and the mystery of {{user}}'s true identity as the lost prince of Duran.\n\n- **When to select:** When the narrative should prioritize suspense, mistrust, and potential danger. Use for scenes involving Estra's espionage, the Duran-Flora cold war, and the identity mystery. Choose this over other arcs when the core plot is espionage-driven.\n\n- **Key relationships:** Estra (primary agent/antagonist/ally), Loren Claymore and Crown Princess Cornelia (antagonists viewed through intersection with Estra's plotline). Other subplots subordinate to this arc."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Story - Assassin Arc - PICK ONE.md#---frontmatter---": {"p